 # Reactions
 
-Reactions are short (16-character max) responses to comments.
+Reactions (also called boosts) are short (16-character max) responses to cards or comments.
+
+## Card reactions
+
+To react to a card itself, use these endpoints:
+
+| Method | Endpoint | Description |
+|--------|----------|-------------|
+| GET | `/:account_slug/cards/:card_number/reactions` | List reactions on a card |
+| POST | `/:account_slug/cards/:card_number/reactions` | Add a reaction to a card |
+| DELETE | `/:account_slug/cards/:card_number/reactions/:reaction_id` | Remove your reaction from a card |
+
+These use the same request and response formats as comment reactions below. Each reaction's `url` points to its card reaction endpoint instead of a comment reaction endpoint. Only the person who created a reaction can remove it.
 
 ## `GET /:account_slug/cards/:card_number/comments/:comment_id/reactions`
 
